0 -12 Td
() Tj
0 -12 Td
(The filter status indicator on the lid turns from green to red when replacement is due. To) Tj
0 -12 Td
(replace the cartridge, twist it counterclockwise a quarter turn and lift it out of the) Tj
0 -12 Td
(funnel housing. Dispose of the old cartridge according to local recycling guidelines; do) Tj
0 -12 Td
