0 -12 Td
() Tj
0 -12 Td
(Wash the pitcher, lid, and reservoir by hand with warm water and mild dish soap every two) Tj
0 -12 Td
(weeks. Do not use abrasive scouring pads, as they can scratch the plastic and harbor) Tj
0 -12 Td
(bacteria. The pitcher body is not dishwasher safe; the lid and reservoir top rack are) Tj
0 -12 Td
(dishwasher safe. Never immerse the filter cartridge itself in soapy water. Wipe the) Tj
0 -12 Td
(cartridge housing with a damp cloth only.) Tj
